      <ol>
      <li>The  <code>ocp4-cis</code> and <code>ocp4-cis-node</code> profiles maintain the most up-to-date version of the CIS benchmark as it becomes available in the Compliance Operator. If you want to adhere to a specific version, such as CIS v1.9.0, use the <code>ocp4-cis-1-9</code> and <code>ocp4-cis-node-1-9</code> profiles.</li>
      <li>Node profiles must be used with the relevant Platform profile. For more information, see <em>Compliance Operator profile types</em>.</li>
      <li>All earlier CIS profiles are superceded by CIS v1.9.0. It is recommended to apply the latest profile to your environment.</li>
      <li>To locate the CIS OpenShift Container Platform v4 Benchmark, go to  <a href="https://www.cisecurity.org/benchmark/kubernetes">CIS Benchmarks</a> and click <strong>Download Latest CIS Benchmark</strong>, where you can then register to download the benchmark.</li>
